{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethoria, Azriel was a revered Grugru, a gentle, lumbering creature with the body of a bear and the antlers of an elk. The Grugru were known for their deep connection to the earth and its secrets. Azriel roamed the ancient forests, sharing his wisdom with the other creatures. He possessed the unique ability to communicate with the trees, listening to their whispers and understanding the language of the land. As the seasons changed, Azriel would migrate to different parts of the realm, carrying the memories of the forest with him. His slow, deliberate pace belied a deep understanding of the world and its rhythms. The other creatures looked up to Azriel as a guardian of the natural balance, and his presence was a reminder of the magic that lay just beneath the surface of the everyday world.",
